### M1 Courier mock – demo requests (IntelliJ Ultimate HTTP Client). Start CourierApplication first (port 8084).

### List all parcels
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels

### StandardParcel 1 -> 540 pence, priority 1
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/1/quote

### ExpressParcel 3 -> 1060 pence, priority 3
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/3/quote

### Van at 2000 g -> loaded [3,4,2], skipped [1], 1700 g used, 1840 pence
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/van?capacityGrams=2000

### Van with the default capacity (2000)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/van

### Add a standard parcel -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/standard
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":5,"trackingCode":"CP-1005","weightGrams":2600,"ratePerBlockPence":150}

### The new parcel is quoted (900 pence)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/5/quote

### Unknown ID -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/999/quote

### Bad capacity -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
GET http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/van?capacityGrams=0

### Invalid body (blank tracking code) -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/standard
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":6,"trackingCode":"   ","weightGrams":500,"ratePerBlockPence":100}

### Duplicate tracking code (case ignored) -> 409 CONFLICT
POST http://localhost:8084/api/parcels/standard
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":7,"trackingCode":"cp-1001","weightGrams":500,"ratePerBlockPence":100}
